OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785687480
OL,3,CPrisoner escapes from transport
OL,4,Cvehicle outside court in Liverpool
OL,6,FA prisoner has escaped from a
OL,7,Ftransport vehicle outside Liverpool
OL,8,FMagistrates Court.
OL,10,FStephen Grzyb is charged with a
OL,11,Fdomestic-related burglary.
OL,13,FMerseyside Police say the 22-year-old
OL,14,Fwas being transported from Belle Vale
OL,15,Fcustody suite by GEOAmey, a private
OL,16,Fcontractor.
OL,18,FIt happened at 10am on Saturday
OL,19,Fmorning. Grzyb made off on foot down
OL,20,FRed Cross Street in the direction of
OL,21,FThe Strand.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
