PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785687480
OL,3,CPrisoner escapes from transport
OL,4,Cvehicle outside court in Liverpool
OL,6,FPolice say patrols have also attended
OL,7,Fthe home of the alleged victim in the
OL,8,Fcase to ensure she is safeguarded
OL,9,Fwhile the search is ongoing.
OL,11,FGrzyb is described as white with short
OL,12,Fdark hair and when last seen was
OL,13,Fwearing a navy T-shirt and navy shorts.
OL,15,FInspector Bethan Hannon said: "We
OL,16,Funderstand the concern this incident
OL,17,Fwill cause, and it is vital the public
OL,18,Fcan see Grzyb's face so they can
OL,19,Freport any sightings and help us bring
OL,20,Fhim back into custody as soon as
OL,21,Fpossible.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
