OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785687480
OL,3,CPrisoner escapes from transport
OL,4,Cvehicle outside court in Liverpool
OL,6,F"If you have heard from him or know
OL,7,Fwhere he is, please do the right thing
OL,8,Fand come forward.
OL,10,F"Assisting him in any way will bring
OL,11,Fpolice to your own door, so it is not
OL,12,Fan association worth keeping.
OL,14,F"If you see Grzyb, please call 999
OL,15,Fimmediately. We are carrying out
OL,16,Fextensive enquiries to find him with
OL,17,Fpatrols on foot and CCTV enquiries
OL,18,Fbeing made right across the city
OL,19,Fcentre so that we can return him to
OL,20,Fcustody."
